# Clients

- Call the Nest API only. No Prisma in Next.js or Expo.
- Share types via `packages/types`. Do not duplicate DTO shapes.
- Server state: TanStack Query. Zustand only for client UI state.
- Do not compute commissions or payment release in the client; display API totals.
- Web SEO slugs per `docs/09-WEB.md`. Mobile tab bar per `docs/10-MOBILE.md`.
- Card scanner: no fake recognition before Fase 17.
